# Vercel's serverless builder TRACES imports and copies the files it finds; it
# does not bundle. pnpm's default symlinked node_modules (a flat tree of links
# into .pnpm/) makes that trace unreliable for packages with deep transitive
# graphs like @azure/cosmos - the function then dies at module load with an
# opaque FUNCTION_INVOCATION_FAILED and no response body to debug.
#
# A hoisted linker produces the flat, npm-shaped node_modules the tracer expects.
# Costs some disk and install time; buys a deployment that resolves its imports.
node-linker=hoisted
